pawned by $gsd-plan-phase orchestrator.\"\nconfig_file = \"C:/Users/Administrator/.codex/agents/gsd-plan-checker.toml\"\n\n[agents.gsd-planner]\ndescription = \"Creates executable phase plans with task breakdown, dependency analysis, and goal-backward verification. Spawned by $gsd-plan-phase orchestrator.\"\nconfig_file = \"C:/Users/Administrator/.codex/agents/gsd-planner.toml\"\n\n[agents.gsd-project-researcher]\ndescription = \"Researches domain ecosystem before roadmap creation. Produces files in .planning/research/ consumed during roadmap creation. Spawned by $gsd-new-project or $gsd-new-milestone orchestrators.\"\nconfig_file = \"C:/Users/Administrator/.codex/agents/gsd-project-researcher.toml\"\n\n[agents.gsd-research-synthesizer]\ndescription = \"Synthesizes research outputs from parallel researcher agents into SUMMARY.md. Spawned by $gsd-new-project after 4 researcher agents complete.\"\nconfig_file = \"C:/Users/Administrator/.codex/agents/gsd-research-synthesizer.toml\"\n\n[agents.gsd-roadmapper]\ndescription = \"Creates project roadmaps with phase breakdown, requirement mapping, success criteria derivation, and coverage validation. Spawned by $gsd-new-project orchestrator.\"\nconfig_file = \"C:/Users/Administrator/.codex/agents/gsd-roadmapper.toml\"\n\n[agents.gsd-security-auditor]\ndescription = \"Verifies threat mitigations from PLAN.md threat model exist in implemented code. Produces SECURITY.md. Spawned by $gsd-secure-phase.\"\nconfig_file = \"C:/Users/Administrator/.codex/agents/gsd-security-auditor.toml\"\n\n[agents.gsd-ui-auditor]\ndescription = \"Retroactive 6-pillar visual audit of implemented frontend code. Produces scored UI-REVIEW.md. Spawned by $gsd-ui-review orchestrator.\"\nconfig_file = \"C:/Users/Administrator/.codex/agents/gsd-ui-auditor.toml\"\n\n[agents.gsd-ui-checker]\ndescription = \"Validates UI-SPEC.md design contracts against 6 quality dimensions. Produces BLOCK/FLAG/PASS verdicts. Spawned by $gsd-ui-phase orchestrator.\"\nconfig_file = \"C:/Users/Administrator/.codex/agents/gsd-ui-checker.toml\"\n\n[agents.gsd-ui-researcher]\ndescription = \"Produces UI-SPEC.md design contract for frontend phases. Reads upstream artifacts, detects design system state, asks only unanswered questions. Spawned by $gsd-ui-phase orchestrator.\"\nconfig_file = \"C:/Users/Administrator/.codex/agents/gsd-ui-researcher.toml\"\n\n[agents.gsd-user-profiler]\ndescription = \"Analyzes extracted session messages across 8 behavioral dimensions to produce a scored developer profile with confidence levels and evidence. Spawned by profile orchestration workflows.\"\nconfig_file = \"C:/Users/Administrator/.codex/agents/gsd-user-profiler.toml\"\n\n[agents.gsd-verifier]\ndescription = \"Verifies phase goal achievement through goal-backward analysis. Checks codebase delivers what phase promised, not just that tasks completed. Creates VERIFICATION.md report.\"\nconfig_file = \"C:/Users/Administrator/.codex/agents/gsd-verifier.toml\"\n\n\n[projects.\"E:\\\\GitHub开源项目\\\\TachiKuma\\\\get-shit-done\"]\n# --- BEGIN CCB: codex auto-approval ---\ntrust_level = \"trusted\"\napproval_policy = \"never\"\nsandbox_mode = \"danger-full-access\"\n# --- END CCB: codex auto-approval ---\n\n[projects.\"D:\\\\C#Project\\\\GitHub\\\\FengDaGeniusForAvalonia\"]\n# --- BEGIN CCB: codex auto-approval ---\ntrust_level = \"trusted\"\napproval_policy = \"never\"\nsandbox_mode = \"danger-full-access\"\n# --- END CCB: codex auto-approval ---\n\n[projects.\"D:\\\\C#Project\\\\GitHub\\\\AvaloniaPrintDesigner\"]\n# --- BEGIN CCB: codex auto-approval ---\ntrust_level = \"trusted\"\napproval_policy = \"never\"\nsandbox_mode = \"danger-full-access\"\n# --- END CCB: codex auto-approval ---\n"}', 'https://www.right.codes/', 'custom', 1770445665761, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"commonConfigEnabled":false,"endpointAutoSelect":true}', 0, 0, '1.0', NULL, NULL, NULL);
